{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/javascript/연산자/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>연산자란 프로그래밍에서 특정의 계산을 하기 위해 만들어진 기호들이다. 연산자에는 산술, 관계/비교, 논리, 대입, 복합, 증감연산자 등이 있다.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-info\">\n<p>계산의 우선순위를 갖고있으며 ( ) 연산자로 우선순위를 높일 수 있다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>우선순위 순서 : <strong>전위형증감연산자(++a)</strong> > 산술 > 관계 > 논리 > 대입 > 복합 > <strong>후위형증감연산자 (a++)</strong></li>\n<li>단항연산자 > 이항연산자</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"01-산술-연산자\" style=\"position:relative;\">01. 산술 연산자<a href=\"#01-%EC%82%B0%EC%88%A0-%EC%97%B0%EC%82%B0%EC%9E%90\" aria-label=\"01 산술 연산자 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>이항연산자이며, 계산을 하기위해 사용된다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>뺄셈 (<code class=\"language-text\">-</code>)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>곱셈 (<code class=\"language-text\">*</code>)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>나눗셈 (<code class=\"language-text\">/</code>)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>나머지 (<code class=\"language-text\">%</code>)</strong> = mod (modulus)\n<ul>\n<li>홀수, 짝수, 배수를 판별할 때 사용한다.</li>\n<li>2로 나눠서 나눈 몫이 1이면 홀수, 0이면 짝수</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>숫자의 덧셈, 문자열의 결합 (<code class=\"language-text\">+</code>)</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>숫자와 문자의 결합 = 문자</li>\n<li>숫자+숫자 일 때만 = 숫자</li>\n<li>ex)\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\">console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'당신의 나이는'</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token number\">20</span><span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token number\">30</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token string\">'세입니다'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>   \r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 당신의 나이는 2030세 입니다.   </span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"자동형변환---제외-\" style=\"position:relative;\">자동형변환 ( + 제외 )<a href=\"#%EC%9E%90%EB%8F%99%ED%98%95%EB%B3%80%ED%99%98---%EC%A0%9C%EC%99%B8-\" aria-label=\"자동형변환   제외  permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>문자열 결합의 기능이 없는 <code class=\"language-text\">-</code> <code class=\"language-text\">*</code> <code class=\"language-text\">/</code> <code class=\"language-text\">%</code> 들은 ‘문자화 된 숫자’ (‘100’) 을 자동으로 숫자로 변환하여 계산한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> number <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\nnumber <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> number <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token string\">'50'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\nconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>number<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 50 : 자동형변환으로 숫자로 계산됨</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"강제형변환\" style=\"position:relative;\">강제형변환<a href=\"#%EA%B0%95%EC%A0%9C%ED%98%95%EB%B3%80%ED%99%98\" aria-label=\"강제형변환 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>‘문자화 된 숫자’의 숫자합의 필요한 경우 Number를 사용한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> num1 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'100'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> num2 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'100'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">Number</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>num1<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token function\">Number</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>num2<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\nconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<br>\n<h2 id=\"02-관계-연산자--비교-연산자\" style=\"position:relative;\">02. 관계 연산자 / 비교 연산자<a href=\"#02-%EA%B4%80%EA%B3%84-%EC%97%B0%EC%82%B0%EC%9E%90--%EB%B9%84%EA%B5%90-%EC%97%B0%EC%82%B0%EC%9E%90\" aria-label=\"02 관계 연산자  비교 연산자 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>결과가 <code class=\"language-text\">true</code> / <code class=\"language-text\">false</code> 로 처리된다.<br>\n조건절로 주로 사용된다.<br>\n값은 <code class=\"language-text\">Boolean</code> 으로 나옴</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>크다 (<code class=\"language-text\">></code>)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>크거나 같다 (<code class=\"language-text\">>=</code>)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>작다 (<code class=\"language-text\">&lt;</code>)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>작거나 같다 (<code class=\"language-text\">&lt;=</code>)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>같다 (<code class=\"language-text\">==</code>)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>다르다 (<code class=\"language-text\">!=</code>)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-info\">\n<ul>\n<li>문자일때는 가나다순으로 계산된다.</li>\n<li>자동형변환\n<ul>\n<li>‘문자화 된 숫자’ (‘100’) 을 자동으로 숫자로 변환하여 계산한다.</li>\n<li>양쪽 값 중 하나만 숫자여도 계산이 가능하다. 둘다 문자이면 문자열 순서대로 계산된다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\">console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">100</span> <span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token string\">'50'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">//true : 자동형변환으로 숫자로 계산됨</span>\r\nconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'100'</span> <span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token string\">'50'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">//false : 둘다 문자이므로 문자순으로 계산됨</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"일치-연산자\" style=\"position:relative;\">일치 연산자<a href=\"#%EC%9D%BC%EC%B9%98-%EC%97%B0%EC%82%B0%EC%9E%90\" aria-label=\"일치 연산자 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>같다 (<code class=\"language-text\">===</code>)</strong>: 좌변과 우변의 자료형과 값이 일치함을 나타냄</li>\n<li><strong>다르다 (<code class=\"language-text\">!==</code>)</strong>: 좌변과 우변의 자료형과 값이 불일치함을 나타냄</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token boolean\">true</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'조건에 참입니다.'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 참, 자료형이 달라도 참</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token boolean\">true</span> <span class=\"token operator\">===</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'조건에 참입니다.'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 거짓, 자료형이 달라서 거짓</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<br>\n<h2 id=\"03-논리-연산자\" style=\"position:relative;\">03. 논리 연산자<a href=\"#03-%EB%85%BC%EB%A6%AC-%EC%97%B0%EC%82%B0%EC%9E%90\" aria-label=\"03 논리 연산자 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>일반 논리 연산자와 비트 논리 연산자로 나뉜다</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">true</code>나 <code class=\"language-text\">false</code>를 연산하는 연산자.<br>\n결과가 <code class=\"language-text\">true</code> / <code class=\"language-text\">false</code>로 처리<br>\n조건절로 사용된다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"일반-논리-연산자\" style=\"position:relative;\">일반 논리 연산자<a href=\"#%EC%9D%BC%EB%B0%98-%EB%85%BC%EB%A6%AC-%EC%97%B0%EC%82%B0%EC%9E%90\" aria-label=\"일반 논리 연산자 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>교집합 (<code class=\"language-text\">&amp;&amp;</code>)</strong>: 하나라도 거짓이면 거짓, 모두 참이어야 참\t(이항연산자)</li>\n<li><strong>합집합 (<code class=\"language-text\">||</code>)</strong>: 모두 거짓일때만 거짓, 하나라도 참이면 참\t(이항연산자)</li>\n<li><strong>여집합 (<code class=\"language-text\">!</code>)</strong>: 참은 거짓으로, 거짓은 참으로\n<ul>\n<li>단항 연산자는 이항 연산자보다 연산순위가 높다</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 760px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/ce66b3c6ea44e095a5f37668a9b99eac/efd7b/operator-01.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 52.60416666666667%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/ce66b3c6ea44e095a5f37668a9b99eac/a59e9/operator-01.webp 192w,\n/static/ce66b3c6ea44e095a5f37668a9b99eac/0ca9f/operator-01.webp 384w,\n/static/ce66b3c6ea44e095a5f37668a9b99eac/7df04/operator-01.webp 760w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/ce66b3c6ea44e095a5f37668a9b99eac/3b721/operator-01.png 192w,\n/static/ce66b3c6ea44e095a5f37668a9b99eac/66595/operator-01.png 384w,\n/static/ce66b3c6ea44e095a5f37668a9b99eac/efd7b/operator-01.png 760w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/ce66b3c6ea44e095a5f37668a9b99eac/efd7b/operator-01.png\"\n            alt=\"논리 연산자\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3 id=\"비트-논리-연산자\" style=\"position:relative;\">비트 논리 연산자<a href=\"#%EB%B9%84%ED%8A%B8-%EB%85%BC%EB%A6%AC-%EC%97%B0%EC%82%B0%EC%9E%90\" aria-label=\"비트 논리 연산자 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>비트 곱(<code class=\"language-text\">&amp;</code>)</strong>: 두 비트 모두 1일 때만 1이고, 하나라도 0이면 0</li>\n<li><strong>비트 합(<code class=\"language-text\">|</code>)</strong>: 두 비트 중 하나라도 1이면 1이고, 모두 0이면 0</li>\n<li><strong>비트 부정(<code class=\"language-text\">~</code>)</strong>: 비트 값이 1이면 0, 0이면 1</li>\n<li><strong>배타적 비트합(<code class=\"language-text\">^</code>)</strong>: 두 비트가 같을 때 0이고, 다를 때 1</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> x <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 0101 (2진수로 변환)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> y <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">7</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 0111 (2진수로 변환)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\nresult <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>x <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;</span> y<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 비트곱</span>\r\ndocument<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">write</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"x &amp; y = \"</span><span class=\"token operator\">+</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;br>\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// x &amp; y = 5</span>\r\n\r\nresult <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>x <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> y<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 비트합</span>\r\ndocument<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">write</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"x | y = \"</span><span class=\"token operator\">+</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;br>\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// x | y = 7</span>\r\n\r\nresult <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>x <span class=\"token operator\">^</span> y<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 배타적 비트합</span>\r\ndocument<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">write</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"x ^ y = \"</span><span class=\"token operator\">+</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;br>\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// x ^ y = 2</span>\r\n\r\nresult <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">~</span>x<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 비트 부정</span>\r\ndocument<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">write</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"~x = \"</span><span class=\"token operator\">+</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;br>\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// ~x = -6</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<br>\n<h2 id=\"04-대입-연산자\" style=\"position:relative;\">04. 대입 연산자<a href=\"#04-%EB%8C%80%EC%9E%85-%EC%97%B0%EC%82%B0%EC%9E%90\" aria-label=\"04 대입 연산자 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code class=\"language-text\">변수 = 값</code></strong> : 좌측 변수에 우측 값을 넣어준다</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<h2 id=\"05-복합-연산자\" style=\"position:relative;\">05. 복합 연산자<a href=\"#05-%EB%B3%B5%ED%95%A9-%EC%97%B0%EC%82%B0%EC%9E%90\" aria-label=\"05 복합 연산자 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>축약해서 사용하는 의미의 문법</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>더한 값을 대입 (<code class=\"language-text\">+=</code>)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>뺀 값을 대입 (<code class=\"language-text\">-=</code>)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>곱한 값을 대입 (<code class=\"language-text\">*=</code>)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>나눈 값을 대입 (<code class=\"language-text\">/=</code>)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>나머지 값을 대입 (<code class=\"language-text\">%=</code>)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\">a <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// a = a + 100;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<br>\n<h2 id=\"06-증감-연산자\" style=\"position:relative;\">06. 증감 연산자<a href=\"#06-%EC%A6%9D%EA%B0%90-%EC%97%B0%EC%82%B0%EC%9E%90\" aria-label=\"06 증감 연산자 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>단항연산자</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>증가연산자 (<code class=\"language-text\">++</code>)</strong>: 해당 변수의 값을 1씩 증가\t<code class=\"language-text\">a++;</code> <code class=\"language-text\">++a;</code></li>\n<li><strong>감소연산자 (<code class=\"language-text\">--</code>)</strong>: 해당 변수의 값을 1씩 감소\t<code class=\"language-text\">a--;</code> <code class=\"language-text\">--a;</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"우선순위\" style=\"position:relative;\">우선순위<a href=\"#%EC%9A%B0%EC%84%A0%EC%88%9C%EC%9C%84\" aria-label=\"우선순위 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>후위형 (<code class=\"language-text\">a++;</code>)</strong>: 우선순위가 가장 낮다</li>\n<li><strong>전위형 (<code class=\"language-text\">++a;</code>)</strong>: 우선순위가 가장 높다</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\">a<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// a+=1; a=a+1;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<b